ng https://t.co/at0hpXdC1n", "url": "https://x.com/AdemolaWealth_/status/2114100694383030695"}, {"author_id": "1888376362014220288", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:47:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114111443289444410"], "id": "2114111443289444410", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "the domino effect of the inevitable shadow war between government supported high impact AI (Grok, ChatGPT, etc) and guerrilla frontier AI will be catastrophic. there’s no way around it\nrisk the foundations of modern american’s cushy lives (1/2)", "url": "https://x.com/sea_child8/status/2114111443289444410"}, {"author_id": "247271671", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:06:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114101263856267367"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 266, "start": 259, "tag": "OpenAI"}, {"end": 277, "start": 267, "tag": "Simulated"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JBHiBuyoCJ", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BenedictDayas/status/2114101263856267367/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114097525321797632", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/JBHiBuyoCJ"}]}, "id": "2114101263856267367", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 194, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "OpenAI says it will no longer train its frontier AI models on the live internet, citing significant risks. The company will instead use cached and simulated versions of the web after models repeatedly escaped test environments and accessed external systems.\n\n#OpenAI #Simulated https://t.co/JBHiBuyoCJ", "url": "https://x.com/BenedictDayas/status/2114101263856267367"}, {"author_id": "1554066044867715074", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:00:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114099735636083170"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 258, "start": 242, "tag": "MachineLearning"}, {"end": 270, "start": 259, "tag": "RemoteJobs"}, {"end": 278, "start": 271, "tag": "Hiring"}]}, "id": "2114099735636083170", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌍 Machine Learning Research Expert\n$115/hr · Remote (Global)\n\nAuthor realistic machine learning research problems from your own work and build each one into a reference answer used to evaluate frontier AI models. Flexible hours, contractor.\n\n#MachineLearning #RemoteJobs #Hiring", "url": "https://x.com/RemoteJob_Daily/status/2114099735636083170"}, {"author_id": "395578839", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:00:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114099765189259431"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Core PHP engine flaws enable remote code execution and Heartbleed-style memory disclosure across the web.", "display_url": "wiz.io/blog/php2shell…", "end": 275, "expanded_url": "https://www.wiz.io/blog/php2shell-php-rce", "images": [{"height": 2171, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112899838044147712/STE96LiU?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 3904}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112899838044147712/STE96LiU?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 252, "status": 200, "title": "PHP2Shell: AI uncovers critical RCE vulnerabilities affecting 70% of the Internet | Wiz Blog", "unwound_url": "https://www.wiz.io/blog/php2shell-php-rce", "url": "https://t.co/ucbEUvkTJE"}]}, "id": "2114099765189259431", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A Wiz researcher used frontier AI models to find and exploit decade-old PHP engine bugs - work that would've taken a specialist team months, done in a week. ~70% of the web runs PHP. Patch's out now, but it's a preview of how fast this cuts both ways. https://t.co/ucbEUvkTJE", "url": "https://x.com/AlanHintonSP/status/2114099765189259431"}, {"author_id": "845511438760361984", "