lic_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'm just going to say it @spacexai  has THE WORST Allowance of any Frontier AI\n\nI barely used GrokBot and in 1 day I went through my $100 usage\n\nThis feels like i'm paying $100 for a $10 usage amount\n\nI don't know what's going on with whole Combined Plan thing but it aint working https://t.co/FZzKgll8wY", "url": "https://x.com/1bitlabs/status/2114108323171877212"}, {"author_id": "1446301662608506880", "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:00:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114114805200007599"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/eUHepeV1F0", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NeekoC18/status/2114114805200007599/photo/1", "media_key": "16_2114114795951607809", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/eUHepeV1F0"}]}, "id": "2114114805200007599", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 91, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic and OpenAi launching their Frontier Ai models and slowly letting them loose on the internet causing data breaches and hacking.\n\nThen in 2027 launch some special cyber security models that will be sold to combat these new open-source models. Fortune 500 companies will https://t.co/eUHepeV1F0", "url": "https://x.com/NeekoC18/status/2114114805200007599"}, {"author_id": "1779110627421675520", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:30:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114107306602385763"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/z5itLTzive", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/rdominguezibar/status/2114107306602385763/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114107302672211968", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/z5itLTzive"}]}, "id": "2114107306602385763", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 276, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BREAKING: OpenAI will NO LONGER train its frontier AI models on the live internet!\n\nIt will use cached and simulated copies of the web instead, two weeks after Anthropic began limiting its newest models from the live web too.\n\nA model exploited a misconfiguration to get online on https://t.co/z5itLTzive", "url": "https://x.com/rdominguezibar/status/2114107306602385763"}, {"author_id": "1977011373805830144", "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114114719632240853"], "id": "2114114719632240853", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How do you know whether an AI agent can actually do the job?\n\nNot answer a question about the job.\n\nNot explain how the job should be done.\n\nActually perform it.\n\nXpert Systems Inc. offers 750+ high-fidelity curated datasets for AI model and AI agent training, including a growing", "url": "https://x.com/Pradeep891730/status/2114114719632240853"}, {"author_id": "2088723581823836160", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:00:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114099698923454826"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Learn to Code for Free", "display_url": "freeCodeCamp.org", "end": 231, "expanded_url": "https://freeCodeCamp.org", "images": [{"height": 1080, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112562121745596416/FOFiacLS?format=png&name=orig", "width": 1920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112562121745596416/FOFiacLS?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 208, "status": 200, "title": "freeCodeCamp.org", "unwound_url": "https://www.freecodecamp.org/", "url": "https://t.co/IgXOBMhQig"}]}, "id": "2114099698923454826", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tech YouTubers: Subscriber Movers This Week 📈\n\nBased on 1,832 tracked channels with comparable public subsc